From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:46:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): balance capsule touch feedback symmetry and
 legibility

Shared with Mihon 0072. Keep a diffuse wide halo but brighten the contact core, track both finger coordinates and retain the release location. Give short taps a real peak and a slower same-family fade; deformation follows the same value. Make upper and lower corners symmetric within height bounds. Strengthen background blur, filled label contrast and soft shadow. Current-tab taps, accessibility activation and drags back to that tab have no reselect shortcut; leave legacy handlers outside the capsule intact. Add clock-driven feedback and repeat-tap regression checks.
